H8423.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 4:22; 
son of: Lamech (H3929) and Zillah (H6741); 
brother of: Jabal (H2989), Jubal (H3106) and Naamah (H5279) 
§ Tubal-cain = "thou will be brought of Cain"
son of Lamech by his wife Zillah and the first worker in metal

H8430.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Samuel 1:1; 
son of: Zuph (H6689); 
father of: Elihu (H0453); also called Nahath at 1 Chroniques 6:26; Toah at 1 Chroniques 6:34; 
Another name of to.chu (תֹּחוּ "Tohu" H8459) 
§ Toah = "lowly"
son of Zuph, father of Eliel, and ancestor of Samuel and Heman

H8436.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah(?) living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:20; 
son of: Shimon (H7889); 
brother of: Amnon (H0550H), Rinnah (H7441), Ben-hanan (H1135) 
§ Tilon = "gift"
a Judaite, son of Shimon

H8439G.def:
A man of the tribe of Issachar living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:13; 
son of: Issachar (H3485); 
brother of: Puah (H6312), Jashub (H3437H) and Shimron (H8110B); 
father of: Uzzi (H5813H), Rephaiah (H7509I), Jeriel (H3400), Jahmai (H3181), Ibsam (H3005) and Shemuel (H8050I)
Also named: to.la.i (תּוֹלָעִי "Tolaite" H8440)
§ Tola = "worm"
1) the 1st born of Issachar and progenitor of the family of Tolaites
2) a man of Issachar, son of Puah and judge of Israel after Abimelech

H8440.def:
Someone descended from Tola who was a man of the tribe of Issachar living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:13; 
son of: Issachar (H3485); 
brother of: Puah (H6312), Jashub (H3437H) and Shimron (H8110B); 
father of: Uzzi (H5813H), Rephaiah (H7509I), Jeriel (H3400), Jahmai (H3181), Ibsam (H3005) and Shemuel (H8050I)
Group of to.la (תּוֹלָע "Tola" H8439) 
§ Tolaites, of Tola "worm"
descendants of Tola the son of Issachar

H8459.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Samuel 1:1; 
son of: Zuph (H6689); 
father of: Elihu (H0453); also called Nahath at 1 Chroniques 6:26; Toah at 1 Chroniques 6:34; 
§ Tohu = "lowly"
Levite, son of Zuph, father of Elihu, and great grandfather of Samuel

H8465G.def:
A man of the tribe of Ephraim living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at Nombres 26:35; 
son of: Ephraim (H0669); 
brother of: Shuthelah (H7803), Becher (H1071H), Ezer (H5827), Elead (H0496) and Beriah (H1283H)
Also named: ta.cha.ni (תַּחֲנִי "Tahanite" H8470)
§ Tahan = "camp"
an Ephraimite, son of Telah and progenitor of a family of Ephraim

H8465H.def:
A man of the tribe of Ephraim living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:25; 
son of: Telah (H8520); 
father of: Ladan (H3936)
§ Tahan = "camp"
an Ephraimite, son of Telah and progenitor of a family of Ephraim

H8468.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:12; 
son of: Eshton (H0850); 
brother of: Beth-rapha (H1051) and Paseah (H6454); 
father of: Ir-nahash (H5904) 
§ Tehinnah = "supplication"
a Judaite, son of Eshton and father of Ir-Nahash

H8470.def:
Someone descended from Tahan who was a man of the tribe of Ephraim living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at Nombres 26:35; 
son of: Ephraim (H0669); 
brother of: Shuthelah (H7803), Becher (H1071H), Ezer (H5827), Elead (H0496) and Beriah (H1283H)
Group of ta.chan (תַּ֫חַן "Tahan" H8465) 
§ Tahanites, of Tachan "thou will decline"
descendants of Tachan, son of Telah, an Ephraimite

H8475.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:35; 
son of: Micah (H4318H); 
brother of: Pithon (H6377), Melech (H4429) and Ahaz (H0271H); also called Tahrea at 1 Chroniques 9:41; 
Another name of ta.a.re.a (תַּאֲרֵעַ "Tarea" H8390) 
§ Tahrea = "cunning"
a Benjamite, son of Micah in the line of Saul

H8477.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, only mentioned at Genèse 22:24; 
son of: Nahor (H5152H) and Reumah (H7208); 
brother of: Tebah (H2875), Gaham (H1514) and Maacah (H4601); 
half-brother of: Uz (H5780H), Buz (H0938), Kemuel (H7055), Chesed (H3777), Hazo (H2375), Pildash (H6394), Jidlaph (H3044), Bethuel (H1328A) 
§ Thahash = "dugong"
son of Nahor by his concubine Reumah and nephew of Abraham

H8485G.def:
A man of the Arabs living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 25:15; 
son of: Ishmael (H3458); 
brother of: Nebaioth (H5032), Kedar (H6938), Adbeel (H0110), Mibsam (H4017), Mishma (H4927), Dumah (H1746), Massa (H4854), Hadad (H2301), Jetur (H3195), Naphish (H5305), Kedemah (H6929) and Mahalath (H4258)
§ Tema = "desert"
1) the 9th son of Ishmael
2) the land settled by Tema the son of Ishmael

H8488.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:6; 
son of: Ashhur (H0806) and Naarah (H5292B); 
brother of: Ahuzzam (H0275), Hepher (H2660) and Haahashtari (H0326); 
half-brother of: Zereth (H6889), Izhar (H3328), Ethnan (H0869) and Koz (H6976) 
§ Temeni = "southern"
a Judaite, son of Ashur by one of his two wives Naarah

H8493.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:16; 
son of: Jehallelel (H3094); 
brother of: Ziph (H2128J), Ziphah (H2129) and Asarel (H0840) 
§ Tiria = "fear"
a Judaite, son of Jehaleleel

H8494.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 10:2; 
son of: Japheth (H3315); 
brother of: Gomer (H1586), Magog (H4031), Madai (H4074), Javan (H3120), Tubal (H8422) and Meshech (H4902) 
§ Tiras = "desire"
son of Japheth and grandson of Noah
